UC4 STEP 01-exact-save: main 1-5/G1/G2: exact CRLF/Unicode file saved in a five-field file-origin envelope; unfinished object makes no server change; second tab list refreshes
UC4 STEP 02-reload-download: main 6/G3/G4: reload and selection preserve exact CRLF bytes; browser-local download matches the original file
UC4 STEP 03-declines: 1b/4b/6a: declined selection, file opening, revert and named replacement preserve exact open and saved text
UC4 STEP 04-replace: main 4-6/G2: confirmed named replacement stores exact edited text, saved-source derivation and explicit save time
UC4 STEP 05-validation: 4a/G1/G4: first syntax line/column, reserved/invalid labels and non-object roots refused; malformed text still downloads exactly
UC4 STEP 06-storage-failure: 5a/minimal: injected browser quota and SecurityError preserve overwritten entry and open text; exact Download remains available
UC4 STEP 07-file-failures: 1c/4a: oversized UTF-8 file/editor and injected unreadable file refused; prior storage and text retained
UC4 STEP 08-corrupt: 1a/G2/G3: corrupt, unsupported and reserved-key entries stay unreadable, cannot execute and can only be explicitly deleted; samples remain immutable
UC4 STEP 09-cross-tab: main 5/G7: cross-tab replacement refreshes newest-first list without overwriting open text; declined reload retains it, explicit reload adopts exact stored text
UC4 STEP 10-deletions: main 6/6a/G3/minimal: declined, failed and confirmed single/all deletion preserve workspace, unrelated preferences and unsaved text; other tab retains removed version text
UC4 STEP 11-in-use-narrow: G5/G6: actual loaded sample remains marked across selection/reload; 390px read-only editor has no page overflow
UC4 STEP 12-no-server-work: G1/G6/G7: all local edits/saves/files/downloads send zero documents or labels and start zero visitor processes; saved copy is not falsely marked In use
UC4 STEP 13-accepted-repair-tracking: G6: real packaged Small repair leaves sample In use during proposal, then explicit acceptance changes definition and clears every dropdown mark
UC4 STEP 14-import-origin: G6: real same-definition accepted-bundle import shows its own origin, never a sample/saved mark; browser versions and second visitor remain intact
